    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2014-tumor-02: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.64";
    dc:description "Each listed hallmark has a standard assay and published measurements are available. Existing data can test the Xenopus phenotype but only partially address the comparison with the heterogeneous scope of human tumors.";
