    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify proliferation, nuclear area, hypoxia, intracellular pH, and leukocyte recruitment in oncogene-induced structures versus matched unaffected tissue, then compare effect directions with standard tumor hallmarks. Consistent significant differences support phenotypic similarity.";
