    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Raw images and per-embryo measurements are not clearly deposited.", "Sharing hallmarks does not establish equivalence to human tumors.";
